</div> <p class="vy-vy-vy-ksg-testimonial-card__quote">My nine-year-old asked me why we have two eyes instead of one. I didn't know. He found the answer in here himself and spent forty-five minutes reading about vision and the brain. His teacher called two weeks later to say he was the most engaged kid in class.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div data-rid="abcb733a-9370-49f5-b749-cfa0a24923fc" class="vy-vy-vy-r-wn1wvb"></div>
<div data-rid="e1b96420-2e8e-4837-9676-43289f2f7039" class="vy-vy-vy-r-16b62uz"><div data-rid="7605444d-9fda-41fc-b867-a3e902370565" class="vy-vy-vy-r-1vsh15v">
<div data-rid="acee2087-db94-4e71-a241-c9336724e6bc" class="vy-vy-vy-r-1d4ddu"><div data-rid="d128cf65-728b-43c1-8bdd-3bda1f7c82a1" class="vy-vy-vy-r-1st0inc vy-vy-vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>If you've read this far, your grandchild deserves a gift that lasts</h2></span></div></div>
<div data-rid="51e7f9ad-c40a-4a1c-9d8b-26d795c75b07" class="vy-vy-vy-r-m9mqf9"><div data-rid="60665b4d-00bd-4995-98f8-6a4e6031cedf" class="vy-vy-vy-r-7jifr9 vy-vy-vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For two years I watched a curious little boy slowly disappear into a screen and told myself it was normal.<br><br></p>
<p>The sinking feeling every time I saw him zoned out on a tablet. The "that's just kids now" from everyone around me. The toys and apps I'd tried before that taught him nothing.<br><br></p>
<p>But at that Sunday dinner, watching him light up telling the whole table why volcanoes erupt, <strong>it was never about a quick fix.</strong><br><br></p>
<p>It was about giving <strong>him</strong> something that actually feeds his curiosity, while he got to fall back in love with learning.<br><br></p>
<p>For months I told myself this is just how kids are now and there's nothing to be done. <strong>I'd stopped expecting to see that spark in him again.</strong><br><br></p>
<p>Six weeks in, he was curious, talkative, and reading for the joy of it. That was the moment I stopped worrying and was simply glad I'd found the right gift.</p></span></div></div>
</div></div>
